            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1e3a5f' fontname='Calibri' fontsize='14'>Has home advantage changed over time?</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Æ </run>
          </formatted-text>
        </title>
